 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "Index list must match tensor rank", "ExampleSubsection",ExpressionUUID->
   "7a11433e-9636-46a6-9ae2-3788c240eb9c"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSubsection",
 CellID->433415080,ExpressionUUID->"476428d3-37a0-4e31-abc3-0f6f785e3e43"],

Cell["\<\
If the number of supplied indices does not match the rank of the new tensor, \
the result is held unevaluated and fails the network predicate:\
